      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The long follow-up after heart transplantation is influenced by the occurrence of graft-coronary artery disease. This complication remains a diagnostic, prognostic and therapeutical dilemma. This short review gives an insight into the principal aspects concerning this complication."},
